   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Anamorphic Flare\n\nA point of light stretches into a cinematic horizontal streak that sweeps the frame and reveals the logo behind it. The placeholder lockup is a stand-in: a host swaps in its own logo by editing the .af-logo element.\n\nCategory: logo-stings. Length: 2.333 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A film, studio, automotive or premium product needs a cinematic opener with a lens-flare look.\n- You want a fast left-to-right sweep that has a centered logo fully revealed by about 0.7 s.\n\nAvoid when:\n- The light should search and land on the logo like a stage light: use spotlight.\n- You want warm light flooding a cut between two scenes, not a logo reveal: use light-leak.\n\nVariables:\n- text (string): Wordmark, default \"studio\"\n- tint (color): Tint, default \"#E5322D\"\n- core_color (color): Core, default \"#FFFFFF\"\n- background_color (color): Background, default \"#111111\"\n- ghosts (number, 0-12): Ghosts, default 4\n- y (number, 0-1): Streak height, default 0.5\n- seed (number, 1-99): Seed, default 2\n- speed (number, 0.25-3): Speed, default 1\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
